OL,14,     FKerry host the week's second
OL,15,     Fvisit, at Stable Oak Cottages in
OL,16,     FMaidstone, Kent. But will the DIY
OL,17,     Ffacilities and a messy bathroom
OL,18,     Fcost them the competition?
